# The value in one breath: an agent is at work, one chord keeps the Mac awake, the
# lid closes, and the work goes on.
clock 22:40 · battery 76 · floor 15
agent claude ~/billing
agent history "Migrate billing to the v2 API and run the whole test suite."
agent work "Migrating billing to the v2 API"

key
caption "One chord keeps the Mac awake."
lid close
time +1h50m · battery 58
caption "Lid closed, still working."
lid open
